# Version on every push

Do **not** `git push` to `master` without a new semver.

```bash
npm run version:push          # patch bump + tag + push
# or
npm run version:minor -- --push
```

`scripts/require-version-bump.mjs` and `.githooks/pre-push` enforce `package.json` version > latest remote `v*` tag.

After tagging, Linux AppImage CI runs automatically. Sync the website with `--sync-market` when downloads should move.
